OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain moving in from 
OL,6,Fthe west, gradually affecting all      
OL,7,Fparts of the region by late morning.   
OL,8,FRain may turn to snow or freezing rain 
OL,9,Facross the high ground of the Peak     
OL,10,FDistrict. Feeling rather cold.         
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with outbreaks  
OL,13,Fof light rain overnight. Any breaks in 
OL,14,Fthe cloud should be short lived.       
OL,15,FHeavier outbreaks of rain across       
OL,16,Fwestern counties by Saturday morning.  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
